Root Certification Authority, ePKI Root Certification Authority, Atos
TrustedRoot 2011 and SecureSign Root CA12 are out; SECOM TLS RSA / ECC Root
CA 2024 and Telia RSA / EC TLS Root CA v3 are in. 121 certificates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
